      "role": "user",
      "content": "but thats just something people say to feel better. if you look at it logically, if there's no ultimate purpose or meaning to any of it, then life and death are basically just two different states of nothingness. they're actually mathematically equal in value, aren't they? it's like choosing between two zeros.",
